  "id": "avoidance-training",
  "term": "avoidance training",
  "definition": "Avoidance training, in this context, refers to Approach Avoidance Training, a computer-based cognitive bias modification program that aims to reduce an automatic tendency to approach alcohol-related cues. It is used as an adjunct to usual treatment for alcohol use disorder to target implicit alcohol approach bias.",
